{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (PATIENT): I'm terribly sorry we're late, doctor. The bus simply would not come.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): Mm. Sorry, one second, this screen has frozen again. What did you say?",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (PATIENT): Only that we were delayed. I do apologise.",
  "[SEG0004] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): And the car park was a nightmare, honestly. We circled for ages.",
  "[SEG0005] person_2 (DOCTOR): Right. Um, so what brings you in today? I was clicking about and I missed it.",
  "[SEG0006] person_1 (PATIENT): Of course. I have come because of pain in my bones. It has been going on for two days.",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (DOCTOR): Bone pain, two days. Hang on, the notes are loading. You've got sickle cell disease, is that right?",
  "[SEG0008] person_1 (PATIENT): Yes, doctor. I have had sickle cell disease since childhood.",
  "[SEG0009] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Since he was a baby, really. He's twenty-two now.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (DOCTOR): Where is the pain, exactly?",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (PATIENT): Both thighs, and a little across the lower back. It is a deep ache, and I would call it moderate.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (DOCTOR): Sorry, moderate, both thighs? Say that once more, the cursor jumped.",
  "[SEG0013] person_1 (PATIENT): Yes. Moderate pain in both thighs and the lower back, for two days.",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any fever with this?",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (PATIENT): Umm, I feel a little warm. It is only mild, I think. I am not shaking.",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (DOCTOR): Right, the observations. Blood pressure one oh nine over seventy-seven. Pulse says eighty-eight, no, sorry, that was last year, today it is ninety-two.",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (PATIENT): I beg your pardon, the temperature?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (DOCTOR): Temperature is thirty-eight point three. Oxygen saturations are ninety-eight percent. And weight, last time in March you were sixty-eight, today you are seventy-one point four kilos.",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (PATIENT): Thank you, that is clear.",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any shortness of breath?",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (PATIENT): No, doctor.",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (DOCTOR): Chest pain?",
  "[SEG0023] person_1 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (DOCTOR): And your breathing generally, any problems there at all?",
  "[SEG0025] person_1 (PATIENT): No, my breathing is quite normal.",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (DOCTOR): Err, what medicines are you taking? Slowly, please, I'm still on this screen.",
  "[SEG0027] person_1 (PATIENT): I take folick acid by mouth, five milligrams each morning, and hydroxyuria, also by mouth, five hundred milligrams once a day. Both are for the sickle cell.",
  "[SEG0028] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): The hospital mentioned gabapentin for the pain once, but he never actually took it.",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (PATIENT): That is correct. I never started gabapentin.",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (DOCTOR): Did you stop anything?",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (PATIENT): I was taking penicillin, two hundred and fifty milligrams twice a day, but I stopped it in March.",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (DOCTOR): Okay. Chest sounds clear, tummy is soft, and both thighs are quite tender.",
  "[SEG0033] person_1 (PATIENT): Yes, they are rather sore.",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (DOCTOR): I think this is a mild sickle cell painful crisis. I'll send blood tests today, a full blood count, reticulocytes and kidney function. Please drink at least two litres today, and I'll prescribe paracetamol by mouth, one gram four times a day.",
  "[SEG0035] person_1 (PATIENT): Thank you. Will I need a scan?",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (DOCTOR): We might do an x-ray of the thighs if the pain does not settle in a few days. I'll see you in one week anyway, or sooner if the fever climbs or the pain gets worse."
 ],
